      "raw": "[quote=\"Geneticdrift\"]\n\nHello again, tiny mortals. I have returned and am ready to feast.\n\n[/quote]\n\n[quote=\"metlarcturus\"]\n\nThat seemed like a weird one. Oddly congenial. It sounds like Gloomy&#39;s about to ask for a Snickers.\n\n[/quote]\n\nHuh, is it Halloween already? It coes earlier every year...And me without any candy. You think Gloomy would wait for me to pop out and hit the Walmart before he tries to feast on the torment of the innocent?\n",
